            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abigisha b’ivyagezwe n’abaherezi bakurubakuru barondera ingene bomufata ubwo nyene, kuko bari batahuye ko ari bo ariko aravuga muri uwo mugani, ariko batinya abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko batangura kumugenza, bahera abantu bigize abubaha Imana ngo bamutegere mu majambo avuga, kugira ngo baronke ivyo bamurega ku bategetsi b’Abaroma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba bantu babaza Yesu bati: “Mwigisha, turazi ko uvuga kandi wigisha ivy’ukuri. Nta ho uhengamira, kandi wigisha inzira y’Imana mu kuri kwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero tubwire: mbega biremewe gutanga ikori rya Kayisari, canke ntivyemewe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
